  "description": "\ud83c\udfe0 Homepage | \ud83e\udd17 Huggingface Datasets\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPDF-WuKong: A Large Multimodal Model for Efficient Long PDF Reading with End-to-End Sparse Sampling\n\t\n\nThis directory contains the data for the paper PDF-WuKong: A Large Multimodal Model for Efficient Long PDF Reading with End-to-End Sparse Sampling\n and a code for extracting text and image information from XML documents:\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tRepository Structure\n\t\n\nThe structure of this repository is shown as follows.\nPDF-Wukong\n\u2502\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 PaperPDF.py\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/yh0075/PaperPDF.",
